265	/**
266	 * Edit the body of your own message, within 5 minutes of sending it, while the
267	 * ticket is open. The 5-minute window is enforced HERE against `createdAt` —
268	 * never trust a client-side countdown, which only controls whether the "Edit"
269	 * affordance is shown. `editedAt` is set so both the admin and customer UI can
270	 * render an "(edited)" label — an edit is a transparency signal both parties
271	 * see, unlike the read receipts below which are staff-facing only.
